DB[9347]={id=9347,zoneId=3483,name=[[Voidwalkers Gone Wild]],level=61,minLevel=255,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9347]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Examining the essence reveals violent swirls of energy sealed within a vessel made of unidentifiable material. As you consider it,you can feel it beginning to tug at your mind,inviting you to come closer and to look deeper. Feeling your will begin to slip away,you break your gaze immediately. Its presence remains at the edge of your consciousness as you determine what to do with it.]],logDesc=[[Bring the Pulsating Voidwalker Essence to Mahuram Stouthoof in Thrallmar.]]}
DB[9348]={id=9348,zoneId=3483,name=[[Ravager Roundup]],level=61,minLevel=255,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9348]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Outland is rife with fascinating creatures. Fascinating -- and extremely dangerous. The area is rich with predators,which seems strange for such a barren land,but a closer look reveals something of a hierarchy. The rock flayers seem to have domesticated another predator,the ravager,and breed them as hunting companions and guard animals. I need to know more about how they're training these ravagers. We must shut down and examine their breeding site to the southwest,near the Terokkar Forest.]],logDesc=[[Slay 10 Captive Ravager Hatchlings and retrieve 12 Ravager Eggs for Mahuram Stouthoof in Thrallmar.]],choiceRewards={{id=25980,qty=1},{id=25981,qty=1},{id=25979,qty=1}}}
DB[9350]={id=9350,zoneId=3483,name=[[A Peon's Work is Never Done]],level=61,minLevel=58,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9350]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[The Legion's constant assaults take a heavy toll on our defenses. If the palisade falls,so will Thrallmar. I've assigned peons to reinforce and repair the walls,but we're running out of materials. Grelag,one of the Far Seer's students,is well versed in the old ways and suggested returning to an ancient practice. Long ago,the clefthoof hunt supplied us with meat,hides,and bones. Taking up the hunt again,with the clefthoof to the southeast,would provide what's needed and honor the ancestors.]],logDesc=[[Gather 8 Clefthoof Hides and 8 sets of Clefthoof Bones from the Raging Clefthoof. Return to Watch Commander Krunk in Thrallmar once you have all the materials.]],choiceRewards={{id=25982,qty=1},{id=25983,qty=1},{id=25984,qty=1}}}
DB[9353]={id=9353,name=[[Redeem iCoke Gift Box Voucher]],name_loc=[[Canjear vale de caja de regalos iCoke]],level=-1,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=-9027,poiY=-110,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9353]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],rewards={{id=23224,qty=1}}}
DB[9354]={id=9354,zoneId=3483,name=[[Searching for New Materials]],level=61,minLevel=58,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9354]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<The dwarf looks up from his work expectantly.> If you're looking to commission a piece,get in line,$c. I've got my hands full maintaining the Sons' equipment and preparing us for the day when we'll take the battle to the enemy again. Our metal stocks are getting very low since crust borers invaded the mines. I've been experimenting with natural materials from the raging clefthoof that graze in the areas northeast of the Hold,and while they're no substitute for iron,I'm learning to make do.]],logDesc=[[Gather 8 Clefthoof Hides and 8 Clefthoof Sinews from the Raging Clefthoof. When you have the materials,bring them to Humphry in Honor Hold.]],choiceRewards={{id=25982,qty=1},{id=25983,qty=1},{id=25984,qty=1}}}
DB[9362]={id=9362,name=[[Warlord Krellian]],name_loc=[[Señor de la guerra Krellian]],level=60,minLevel=60,giver=[[Archmage Xylem]],giver_loc=[[Archimago Xylem]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=8379,ender=[[Archmage Xylem]],ender_loc=[[Archimago Xylem]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=8379,rewardNextId=9364,poiX=3548,poiY=-5357,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9362]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[There isn't much time, $n!  My scrying spells have revealed a powerful source of magic.  I cannot leave the tower, and would ask you to kill the vile creature in possession of this artifact. The pathetic little cretin is known as Warlord Krellian, hiding behind his guards in the Temple of Zin-Malor.  Burn him to ashes and take the prismatic shell he covets so dearly.]],logDesc=[[Retrieve the Prismatic Shell for Archmage Xylem.  The Archmage resides in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara.]]}
DB[9364]={id=9364,name=[[Fragmented Magic]],name_loc=[[Magia fragmentada]],level=-1,minLevel=60,giver=[[Archmage Xylem]],giver_loc=[[Archimago Xylem]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=8379,ender=[[Archmage Xylem]],ender_loc=[[Archimago Xylem]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=8379,prevId=9362,poiX=3982,poiY=-4760,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9364]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[My research has revealed a unique purpose for the prismatic shell. Carry the shell and cast your polymorph spell on the Spitelash in Azshara.  If you wait a few moments, the chaotic aura of the shell will cause them to split into several smaller clones for a few moments.  Kill these clones as quickly as possible, and the shell will collect their essence. When the shell is full, return it to me.]],logDesc=[[Polymorph the Spitelash of Azshara and kill the clones that appear several seconds later.  When you have slain 50 Polymorph Clones, return to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.]]}
DB[9365]={id=9365,name=[[A Thief's Reward]],name_loc=[[Una recompensa de ladrón]],level=-1,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],ender=[[Festival Loremaster]],ender_loc=[[Maestro cultural del Festival]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=16817,poiX=-8833,poiY=862,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9365]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[This flame, stolen from the heart of Stormwind itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the (NAME) might know more...]],logDesc=[[Return the Flame of Stormwind to (NAME).]],rewards={{id=23323,qty=1}}}
DB[9367]={id=9367,name=[[The Festival of Fire]],name_loc=[[El Festival del Fuego]],level=-1,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=-8837,poiY=858,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9367]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Midsummer is upon us once again! Each year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season. In fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!]],logDesc=[[Touch the bonfires within Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, then speak to a Festival Loremaster within the capital cities.]],rewards={{id=23247,qty=10},{id=23246,qty=10}}}
DB[9368]={id=9368,name=[[The Festival of Fire]],name_loc=[[El Festival del Fuego]],level=-1,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=-1038,poiY=293,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9368]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Midsummer is upon us once again! Each year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season. In fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!]],logDesc=[[Touch the bonfires within Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, then speak to a Festival Talespinner within the capital cities.]],rewards={{id=23247,qty=10},{id=23246,qty=10}}}
DB[9377]={id=9377,zoneId=3483,name=[[Thirsting For Power]],level=63,minLevel=61,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9377]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Falcon Watch serves as a stop for pilgrims on their long journey into Outland. Although we are an early stop on the way,many of the pilgrims reach us exhausted and wracked by their addictions. In a world such as this,many find it necessary to relearn mastery of their magical addiction. Food and drink help,$c,but magical energy is their greatest need. The remains of Outland's voidwalkers provide a potent source of energy,but they grow rare and can only be found in the Warp Fields to the southwest.]],logDesc=[[Retrieve a Potent Voidwalker Essence from the Vengeful Voidwalkers and return to Taleris Dawngazer at Falcon Watch.]]}
DB[9378]={id=9378,zoneId=139,name=[[DND FLAG The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas]],name_loc=[[DND FLAG La ciudadela del terror: Naxxramas]],level=60,minLevel=60,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=2295,poiY=-5340,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9378]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now. We have devised a way to gain entry via a permanent arcane cloaking of sorts - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. With that said, the cloaking is costly; however, your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is unwavering! We will waive all cost associations.]],logDesc=[[Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will grant you Arcane Cloaking at no cost. You must be Exalted with the Argent Dawn.]]}
DB[9379]={id=9379,zoneId=3483,name=[[Fortifying the Felhunter]],level=61,minLevel=58,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9379]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Greetings,$c. Say hello to Jir'see here,too. Don't worry,he won't bite unless I tell him to. <Angela makes a cooing sound at the felhunter.> He's so tiny in comparison to the warp hounds that live in Outland. But we're going to fix that right up,yes we are,aren't we,Jir'see? I think I've figured out a way to do it. I'll need plenty of blood from the warp hounds and that's where you come in. While you're hunting them in the southeast,I'll get ready for the experi... err,treatment.]],logDesc=[[Gather 6 Warp Hound Blood and bring them to Angela "The Claw" Kestrel in Thrallmar.]]}
DB[9386]={id=9386,name=[[A Light in Dark Places]],name_loc=[[Una luz en la oscuridad]],level=-1,minLevel=50,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],prevId=9319,poiX=535,poiY=602,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9386]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[An eager one, aren't you? If you're willing to enter the depths once more, I'll gladly reward you. Seek out the bonfires burning within Stratholme, Scholomance, Dire Maul, and the halls of Blackrock Spire itself; I look forward to your return, $n.]],logDesc=[[Find and touch the bonfires located within Blackrock Spire, Dire Maul, Scholomance, and Stratholme, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.]],rewards={{id=23247,qty=10}}}
DB[9388]={id=9388,name=[[Flickering Flames in Kalimdor]],name_loc=[[La oscilación de las llamas de Kalimdor]],level=25,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=1919,poiY=-2037,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9388]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[There are many flames burning throughout the world today, $n. The trickiest fires to tend are those that burn green; they do not stay lit long without supervision. Make certain the emerald fires still burn on Kalimdor for our Flamekeeper, eh? You will find them near Ratchet in the Barrens, close to the Master's Glaive in Darkshore, in the forest of Ashenvale by the bridge near Silverwing Outpost, and near the road to Windshear Crag along the main road in Stonetalon Mountains.]],logDesc=[[Visit the bonfires within Ashenvale, the Barrens, Darkshore, and Stonetalon Mountains, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.]],choiceRewards={{id=23435,qty=5},{id=23327,qty=4},{id=23326,qty=5},{id=23211,qty=5}}}
DB[9389]={id=9389,name=[[Flickering Flames in the Eastern Kingdoms]],name_loc=[[La oscilación de las llamas de los Reinos del Este]],level=25,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=-322,poiY=-674,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9389]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[The Midsummer Fire Festival traditionally lights up the land with a myriad of flames. Some argue that the green fires are the finest, as they are the hardest to maintain and have such a distinctive hue. Make sure they still burn in the Eastern Kingdoms for our Flamekeeper. They sit near Dun Modr in the Wetlands, close to Pyrewood Village within Silverpine Forest, on the cliffs overlooking the lighthouse in Westfall, and by the ruined tower in Hillsbrad Foothills.]],logDesc=[[Visit the bonfires within Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest, Westfall, and the Wetlands, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.]],choiceRewards={{id=23435,qty=5},{id=23327,qty=4},{id=23326,qty=5},{id=23211,qty=5}}}
DB[9415]={id=9415,zoneId=1377,name=[[Report to Marshal Bluewall]],name_loc=[[Preséntate ante el alguacil Murazul]],level=60,minLevel=55,giver=[[Rifleman Torrig]],giver_loc=[[Fusilero Torrig]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=17082,ender=[[Marshal Bluewall]],ender_loc=[[Alguacil Murazul]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=17080,rewardNextId=9419,poiX=-7144,poiY=1378,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9415]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Are you Marshal Bluewall's new recruits? Of course you are. What are you waiting for? Good soldiers are dying in the desert. Aren't you excited to join them? Now, get going and don't dry out on the way.]],logDesc=[[Speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.]]}
DB[9416]={id=9416,zoneId=1377,name=[[Report to General Kirika]],name_loc=[[Preséntate ante el general Kirika]],level=60,minLevel=55,giver=[[Scout Bloodfist]],giver_loc=[[Explorador Puñosangre]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=17081,ender=[[General Kirika]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=17079,rewardNextId=9422,poiX=-7574,poiY=770,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9416]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[You must be one of General Kirika's new recruits. It's about time you showed up. Bodies wear down quick in the desert. The dwarves have been getting reinforcements daily, and we can't afford to lose ground in our struggle for resources in Silithus. Get your instructions from the General. It's not my job to train you, just find you.]],logDesc=[[Speak with General Kirika at the Horde encampment near Hive'Regal.]]}
DB[9419]={id=9419,zoneId=1377,name=[[Scouring the Desert]],name_loc=[[Peinando el desierto]],level=60,minLevel=55,giver=[[Marshal Bluewall]],giver_loc=[[Alguacil Murazul]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=17080,ender=[[Marshal Bluewall]],ender_loc=[[Alguacil Murazul]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=17080,prevId=9415,poiX=-7139,poiY=1390,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9419]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[We recently found out that the Horde has been scavenging the Silithus desert for resources, but paid them little mind. We thought it could not be worth it to station large numbers in this sweltering desert. However, it was discovered the importance of the resources, and now we are scrambling to catch up. If I have your assistance, you must go into the desert and recover the silithyst and return it here.]],logDesc=[[Find and deliver Silithyst to the Silithyst Extractor, then speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.]],choiceRewards={{id=13446,qty=2},{id=13444,qty=2}}}
DB[9422]={id=9422,zoneId=1377,name=[[Scouring the Desert]],name_loc=[[Peinando el desierto]],level=60,minLevel=55,giver=[[General Kirika]],giverType=[[NPC]],giverId=17079,ender=[[General Kirika]],enderType=[[NPC]],enderId=17079,poiX=-7569,poiY=763,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9422]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[For some time now, we have been tapping the crystal resources of the Silithus desert. The only dangers we faced were from the creatures that made this place their home and the oppressive sand and dust and heat. But now the Alliance seems to have caught on to what we have found here. It is now a race between us to capture the natural resources, and keep them from the other. I need every set of hands that is available. I hope I have yours.]],logDesc=[[Find and deliver Silithyst to the Silithyst Extractor then speak with General Kirika at the Horde encampment near Hive'Regal.]],choiceRewards={{id=13446,qty=2},{id=13444,qty=2}}}
DB[9497]={id=9497,zoneId=3535,name=[[Emblem of the Fel Horde]],level=70,minLevel=67,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9497]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[When word of the so-called 'Fel Horde' reached the Warchief's ears,he was both furious and greatly saddened. Like Rend's pretenders before them,this false Horde too will fall,and its banner will adorn the wall of Grommash Hold as a testament to the Warchief's might. It falls to you to carry out the Warchief's will in this matter,$N. It will not be an easy task,for the banner is guarded by a champion of this Fel Horde,known as Warbringer O'mrogg,and he will not yield his charge without a fight.]],logDesc=[[Slay Warbringer O'mrogg and capture the Fel Horde Banner,then return it to Overlord Hun Maimfist at Thrallmar.]],choiceRewards={{id=25793,qty=1},{id=25794,qty=1},{id=25795,qty=1},{id=25796,qty=1},{id=25797,qty=1}}}
DB[9507]={id=9507,zoneId=3524,name=[[<DEPRECATED>From the Desk of Mogul Razdunk]],name_loc=[[Del escritorio de Mogul Razdunk]],level=8,minLevel=5,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],poiX=-4700,poiY=-12415,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9507]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[According to these plans,the goblins are here for the crystal wreckage of the Exodar. It would appear that the goblins are intent on strip-mining the island of the crystals and hijacking the two Alliance ships docked off-shore once their task is complete. You should probably take these plans to Admiral Odesyus.]],logDesc=[[Take the Top Secret Venture Co. Plans to Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing.]]}
DB[9546]={id=9546,zoneId=3524,name=[[Fulfilling a Promise]],name_loc=[[Una promesa por cumplir]],level=8,minLevel=7,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],rewardNextId=9559,poiX=-4624,poiY=-11647,wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9546]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[The prophecy spoke of one that would rise and deliver us from the oppressive grasp of Bristlelimb -- that the spirits themselves would herald the arrival of this hero. And now,you have come. I humble myself before you,great one. I beg of you,save our younglings. They were taken by the Bristlelimb while our guard was down. You will find them in cages at Bristlelimb Village,to the southwest. The Bristlelimb furbolgs hold the keys to the cages. Strike them down and take their keys. Release my kin.]],logDesc=[[Arugoo of the Stillpine has asked that you free 8 Stillpine Captives from cages found in Bristlelimb Village.]],choiceRewards={{id=24442,qty=1},{id=24443,qty=1},{id=24444,qty=1}}}
DB[9577]={id=9577,name=[[DAILY TEST QUEST (PVP)]],name_loc=[[DAILY TEST QUEST (PVP)]],level=-1,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9577]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<NYI>Seek <QUESTGIVER> in <LOCATION>.  S/he wishes for you to aid them in a difficult task.]],logDesc=[[Speak with <QUESTGIVER> in the <AREA>.]]}
DB[9583]={id=9583,zoneId=22,name=[[Omar's Test Quest]],level=70,minLevel=1,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9583]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[An honorable person gives me cloth]],logDesc=[[Get Omar some cloth]],rewards={{id=29434,qty=2}},choiceRewards={{id=23425,qty=1},{id=23424,qty=1},{id=23426,qty=1}}}
DB[9596]={id=9596,name=[[<DEPRECATED>Control]],name_loc=[[Control]],level=10,minLevel=10,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9596]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<NYI>Do something else,$c!]],logDesc=[[<NYI>Log description.]],choiceRewards={{id=9513,qty=1},{id=7508,qty=1}}}
DB[9611]={id=9611,zoneId=3524,name=[[Azuremyst: aa - A - Quest Flag 000]],name_loc=[[Bruma Azur: aa - A - Bandera de misión 000]],level=8,minLevel=5,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9611]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]]}
DB[9613]={id=9613,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Keanna's Will]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9613]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<As you touch the sword,you hear a female voice address you> Ouch!  Don't do that!  Can't you see I'm in pieces?  It really hurts. I see that Karazahan hasn't trapped you.  You must know about Kadghar and the Violet Eye then. You're going to need to find someone who can put me back together.  Koren... he was our agent once... he's nearby.  I hope you're on our good side.  If so,he can help!]],logDesc=[[The Shattered Blade you found in Karazhan wants you to ask Koren to repair it.  You'll also need to attain Honored reputation with the Violet Eye to complete this quest.]]}
DB[9614]={id=9614,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Reforge a Short Blade]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9614]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[This weapon has been broken into so many pieces... putting it back together won't be easy. I'm going to need khorium.  Lots of it.  I'll also need a void crystal and some primal fire.]],logDesc=[[Bring 40 Khorium Bars,1 Void Crystal and 8 Primal Fires to Koren inside Karazhan.]],rewards={{id=23905,qty=1}}}
DB[9615]={id=9615,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Reforge a Long Blade]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9615]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[This weapon has been broken into so many pieces... putting it back together won't be easy. I'm going to need khorium.  Lots of it.  I'll also need a void crystal and some primal fire.]],logDesc=[[Bring 40 Khorium Bars,1 Void Crystal and 8 Primal Fires to Koren inside Karazhan.]],rewards={{id=23647,qty=1}}}
DB[9650]={id=9650,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Magical Augmentation]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9650]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<TXT>Yes,let's enhance my magical properties.  That makes sense.  I was,after all,a wizard in life. Just because one's physical vessel is a weapon does not automatically make someone a brute. I will need you to collect some materials.]],logDesc=[[<TXT>]],choiceRewards={{id=23911,qty=1}}}
DB[9651]={id=9651,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Magical Augmentation]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9651]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[<TXT>Yes,let's enhance my magical properties.  That makes sense.  I was,after all,a wizard in life. Just because one's physical vessel is a weapon does not automatically make someone a brute. I will need you to collect some materials.]],logDesc=[[<TXT>]],rewards={{id=23649,qty=1}}}
DB[9652]={id=9652,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Physical Enhancement]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9652]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[I wouldn't mind that.  We might as well make the best of our situation... in my case,being a weapon.  Might as well become the best weapon I can be. Yes,let's do that.  A sharper edge,a sturdier hilt... I like the sound of that. I'll need you to gather a few things for me.]],rewards={{id=23916,qty=1}}}
DB[9653]={id=9653,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: Physical Enhancement]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9653]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[I wouldn't mind that.  We might as well make the best of our situation... in my case,being a weapon.  Might as well become the best weapon I can be. Yes,let's do that.  A sharper edge,a sturdier hilt... I like the sound of that. I'll need you to gather a few things for me.]],rewards={{id=23648,qty=1}}}
DB[9654]={id=9654,zoneId=2562,name=[[Deprecated: A Well Rounded Defense]],level=70,minLevel=70,giverType=[[NPC]],enderType=[[NPC]],wowhead=[[https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/quest=9654]],image=[[assets/images/quests/placeholder.png]],desc=[[Offensive magic was my area of expertise... that much I can remember.  I'll do my best to add my arcane channeling powers to yours. I'll need more raw power than I possess right now,however.  The arcane anomalies that roam the upper levels of the guardian's library would make excellent targets.  Gather their arcane residue,we'll need lots of it.]],logDesc=[[The Facet of Keanna stored inside Keanna's Will wants you to gather 20 Arcane Residues from the Arcane Anomalies in Karazhan.]],rewards={{id=23917,qty=1}}}
